      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your organization should prioritize the following strategic goals: (1) Establish a 5-year moratorium on all new habitat restoration projects that involve heavy human intervention, such as invasive species control, prescribed burns, or artificial habitat creation; (2) Invest 75% of your budget in rewilding-focused initiatives, including monitoring and studying natural ecosystem processes, and (3) Develop a comprehensive \"rewilding readiness\" assessment to identify areas where your organization can transition to a more natural approach, and phase out legacy projects that are incompatible with rewilding principles.",
      "source": "target",
